/function start "Commercial Contract Review"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/governance policy add "Legal analysis requires principal review" --effect require-approval --capability "analysis"
/governance policy inspect "Legal analysis requires principal review"
/task
1
Using synthetic assumptions only, identify the material commercial issues a principal lawyer should check in a software supply agreement: liability, indemnities, IP ownership, data protection, termination, and service levels. Separate general issue-spotting from claims needing the actual contract text. Do not give legal advice or claim to have read a real agreement.
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
